{
 "name": "Turn PDF invoices from Gmail into text and log them in Google Sheets",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "about-this-workflow",
   "name": "About this workflow",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -640,
    40
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## PDF invoices from Gmail to text\n\nGet the text of every PDF that arrives by email, without opening it, and keep a log of it in Google Sheets.\n\n### How it works\n1. **New email with a PDF** (Gmail trigger) watches for emails with a PDF attachment.\n2. **PDF to text** (CompassLab, PDF) extracts the text of the first attachment and lists scanned pages, so you know when a document needs OCR.\n3. **Log the invoice** appends one row per PDF: received, from, subject, pages, scanned pages, text.\n\n### Set up steps (5 minutes)\n1. Connect Gmail in **New email with a PDF**. The search `has:attachment filename:pdf` picks emails with a PDF; narrow it, for example `from:billing@supplier.com`.\n2. Create a sheet with the columns `received`, `from`, `subject`, `pages`, `scanned_pages`, `text` and select it in **Log the invoice**.\n3. In **PDF to text**, create a CompassLab credential with your api.market or RapidAPI key (both have a free plan).\n\n### Customize\nSend `text` to an AI node to pull out the invoice number, date and total.",
    "width": 560,
    "height": 640,
    "color": "6"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "new-email-with-a-pdf",
   "name": "New email with a PDF",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.3,
   "position": [
    0,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "pollTimes": {
     "item": [
      {
       "mode": "everyMinute"
      }
     ]
    },
    "simple": false,
    "filters": {
     "q": "has:attachment filename:pdf"
    },
    "options": {
     "downloadAttachments": true
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "pdf-to-text",
   "name": "PDF to text",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-compasslab.compassLab",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    240,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "resource": "pdf",
    "operation": "extractText",
    "source": "binary",
    "binaryPropertyName": "attachment_0",
    "format": "text"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "log-the-invoice",
   "name": "Log the invoice",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4.7,
   "position": [
    480,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "append",
    "documentId": {
     "__rl": true,
     "value": "",
     "mode": "list",
     "cachedResultName": ""
    },
    "sheetName": {
     "__rl": true,
     "value": "gid=0",
     "mode": "list",
     "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
    },
    "columns": {
     "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
     "value": {
      "received": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
      "from": "={{ $('New email with a PDF').item.json.from?.text ?? '' }}",
      "subject": "={{ $('New email with a PDF').item.json.subject ?? '' }}",
      "pages": "={{ $json.page_count }}",
      "scanned_pages": "={{ $json.scanned_pages.join(', ') }}",
      "text": "={{ ($json.text ?? '').slice(0, 45000) }}"
     },
     "matchingColumns": [],
     "schema": [
      {
       "id": "received",
       "displayName": "received",
       "required": false,
       "defaultMatch": false,
       "display": true,
       "type": "string",
       "canBeUsedToMatch": true
      },
      {
       "id": "from",
       "displayName": "from",
       "required": false,
       "defaultMatch": false,
       "display": true,
       "type": "string",
       "canBeUsedToMatch": true
      },
      {
       "id": "subject",
       "displayName": "subject",
       "required": false,
       "defaultMatch": false,
       "display": true,
       "type": "string",
       "canBeUsedToMatch": true
      },
      {
       "id": "pages",
       "displayName": "pages",
       "required": false,
       "defaultMatch": false,
       "display": true,
       "type": "string",
       "canBeUsedToMatch": true
      },
      {
       "id": "scanned_pages",
       "displayName": "scanned_pages",
       "required": false,
       "defaultMatch": false,
       "display": true,
       "type": "string",
       "canBeUsedToMatch": true
      },
      {
       "id": "text",
       "displayName": "text",
       "required": false,
       "defaultMatch": false,
       "display": true,
       "type": "string",
       "canBeUsedToMatch": true
      }
     ]
    },
    "options": {}
   }
  }
 ],
 "connections": {
  "New email with a PDF": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "PDF to text",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  },
  "PDF to text": {
   "main": [
    [
     {
      "node": "Log the invoice",
      "type": "main",
      "index": 0
     }
    ]
   ]
  }
 },
 "settings": {
  "executionOrder": "v1"
 },
 "meta": {
  "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
  "description": "Extracts the text of PDF attachments from Gmail with the CompassLab node (PDF) and logs sender, subject, pages, scanned pages and text in a Google Sheet."
 }
}
